    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/7da27eeb0482cc00ce4989515415cc99.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>up to 6-player co-op game  </strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>procedurally generated levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unique enemies</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>twitch integration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >close the VENTS, manage your energy and stamina. face unique enemies as you explore different sectors and unlock powerful upgrades.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/3e171320ea0e6ec3919508723ec3c79b.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/e41d8fef535017ed133757391b3139b4.poster.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/e41d8fef535017ed133757391b3139b4.webm?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/e41d8fef535017ed133757391b3139b4.mp4?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >watch out for traps and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/4fb00681caf94c97a19ab5eca436c5d6.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/ff5e308ee98c490981ba9cf27a191a2a.poster.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/ff5e308ee98c490981ba9cf27a191a2a.webm?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/ff5e308ee98c490981ba9cf27a191a2a.mp4?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>play with twitch</strong>. will chat boost your energy - or drain every last drop? let the viewers vote good or bad ...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>turn on the radio. hit party mode. celebrate survival - with your team.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/64ae74a630b71ccbd1588da7b24c0c94.poster.avif?t=1754395935\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/64ae74a630b71ccbd1588da7b24c0c94.webm?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/64ae74a630b71ccbd1588da7b24c0c94.mp4?t=1754395935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
